## Chrome (Claude in Chrome)

Chrome does not run permanently on this machine. Before the first `mcp__claude-in-chrome__*` tool call of a task,
run `claude-browser start` (it waits until the extension is connected). Once the browser work is finished, run
`claude-browser stop`. Chrome also stops by itself after {{ claude_agent_chrome_max_runtime }}: if the browser tools
report that no browser is connected, run `claude-browser start` again.

## Playwright

Playwright for Python is installed: `import playwright` with `python`, and the `playwright` command. Its browsers
({{ claude_agent_playwright_browsers | join(', ') }}) are shared and read-only: `playwright install` fails, ask for
another browser to be added to the Ansible role instead. Use Playwright's own Chromium (headless, blank profile) for
scripts and tests; never connect it to the logged-in Chrome above (its DevTools port or its profile).
